.vs/
*.user
*.useros
*.suo
*.sln.docstates

## Build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
x64/
x86/
ARM/
ARM64/

## NuGet Packages
# Ignore the packages folder if you use the old local packages style
packages/
# Ignore the .nuget folder
.nuget/

## Test Results
TestResults/

## Visual Studio Cache & Temp files
*.tmp
*.log
*.cache
*.kind

